this is the vibe-coding-based minesweeper-bot project

## code defects#

the analyze_board is always target at the whole window,  8-blocks around current block may be faster
the program may in a loop that click a block is open_blank

##start it by yourself#

1 For anyone who want to run the code in win8 and above, please download the win7 package (https://win7games.com) Warning, please make sure the package is virus-free!!!
    open the mine-sweeper window (warning NOT too small)
2 please replace both board_tl.png and board_br.png with the blocks captured from the minesweeper window(top-left block and bottom-right block)

3 runtime environment prepare
    install python version 3.11~3.12
    pip install opencv-python numpy pyautogui

4 enter into minesweeper directory
    right click mouse & choose powershell in this directory menu
    type 'python main.py' & kick the enter key to start the bot
   'python main.py --debug' will generate sequence snapshot of the progress in the workspace for anyone who want to know the detail

5 for anyone who want to go further with the code, please refer to conda-env-config.txt to build your develop environment----for the spirit of open source



I use python to implement it and I look forward to someone trying the implementation version of other languages



